# Everything the build does not need, and two things it must not have.
#
# `node_modules` is rebuilt from the lockfile inside the image, so copying a
# host copy in would defeat `npm ci`'s regression gate and could smuggle a
# platform-specific binary across.
#
# `dist` is rebuilt too. The predecessor to this project shipped a release that
# could not be built from a clean checkout, because the artifact in the
# repository and the source had drifted apart. Refusing to copy one is the
# cheapest way to keep that from happening again.

node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage

.git
.github
.vscode
.idea

*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Documentation and tests are not needed to serve the page.
**/*.md
!examples/playground/README.md
